            <title>[LU-21062] build: objtool error "lbug_with_loc() missing __noreturn" on Linux 6.5+</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21062</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Building against Linux 6.5+ with CONFIG_OBJTOOL_WERROR=y fails:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
# ./autogen.sh
# ./configure --disable-server --with-o2ib=no --with-linux=../linux-7.0 --with-linux-obj=../linux-7.0
...
# make
...
  LD [M]  lnet/libcfs/libcfs.o
lnet/libcfs/libcfs.o: error: objtool: __cfs_fail_check_set+0x218: lbug_with_loc() missing __noreturn in .c/.h or NORETURN() in noreturns.h
lnet/libcfs/libcfs.o: error: objtool: libcfs_force_lbug+0x2a: lbug_with_loc() missing __noreturn in .c/.h or NORETURN() in noreturns.h
lnet/libcfs/libcfs.o: error: objtool: cfs_tracefile_init+0x183: lbug_with_loc() missing __noreturn in .c/.h or NORETURN() in noreturns.h
make[6]: *** [/root/linux/scripts/Makefile.build:510: lnet/libcfs/libcfs.o] Error 1 &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
